  "slug": "warehouse-pick-proof-of-delivery-form",
  "title": "Warehouse Pick Proof of Delivery Form",
  "subtitle": "Authenticate the warehouse pick delivery through unit identity, custody events, recipient authority, location, timing, condition, and privacy-conscious proof.",
  "description": "An original, fillable warehouse pick proof of delivery form for controlling warehouse pick wave, order, carton, and lot allocation through proof of delivery identity, observations, evidence, decision, exceptions, escalation, completion, handoff, and final verification without replacing applicable requirements or professional review.",
  "use_case": "Use after a warehouse pick delivery or failed attempt when operations must establish what was delivered, to whom, where, when, under which control, and how any evidence gap or dispute was routed.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
  "sections": [
    {
      "key": "identity_routing",
      "title": "Warehouse Pick proof of delivery identity and routing",
      "guidance": "Anchor the record to the exact work, parties, locations, and source references.",
